        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/scene_mamushi.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "The snow festival is spreading positive energy across the whole hospital.\rHowever this isn&apos;t stopping annoying people from existing. Dexter has issued a contract on the 4 most annoying people in his opinion (whithout even knowing half of them). Unluck for him, the hospital director wants Dexter gone for annoying his guards.\rThe policy of the company does not allow Dexters Contract to be canceled.\r\rSo go out there, do your thing and complete both in one go.\r\rGood Luck\r\r(contract by Schnummel)",
